# 🎓 EduAI - AI-Based Education Recommendation System

## 📌 Project Overview

EduAI is an AI-powered course recommendation system that recommends relevant learning courses to students based on their interests, skill levels, and learning history.

This project is being developed as an end-to-end AI/ML application with PostgreSQL, Machine Learning, FastAPI, Docker, and GitHub.

---

## 🚀 Technologies Used

- Python
- PostgreSQL
- SQLAlchemy
- Pandas
- Faker
- Scikit-learn
- FastAPI (Upcoming)
- Docker (Upcoming)
- Git & GitHub

