## ▶️ How to Run

Create a virtual environment:

```bash
python -m venv venv
```

Activate:

```bash
venv\Scripts\activate
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Run database scripts:

```bash
python src/database/generate_students.py
python src/database/generate_courses.py
python src/database/generate_enrollments.py
```

